        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="be_bridge" value="robot_bridge.py   (ROBOT_MODE=real)&#xa;• 1 long-lived LocoClient&#xa;• ChannelSubscriber rt/lowstate → _on_low_state → _low_state cache&#xa;• ChannelSubscriber rt/bmsstate&#xa;• get_telemetry(): IMU tilt · motor τ% · max motor temp · BMS soc · frame-age ms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="be_services">
