        <mxCell id="db_box" value="SQLite — backend/chadwick.db&#xa;&#xa;• users      (operator / supervisor, JWT-auth)&#xa;• sessions   (operator session lifecycle)&#xa;• log_entries     (audit, fire-and-forget — broken audit ≠ broken route)&#xa;• telemetry_samples (1 Hz when a session is active)&#xa;• SafetyConfig    (max_speed · turn_rate · temp_warn · temp_stop)&#xa;&#xa;exports:&#xa;   /api/session/{id}/export?format=csv|json&#xa;   /api/session/{id}/telemetry?format=json|csv" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=20;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="db">
